                      >
                        Olorofim for treating invasive fungal infections in people 16 years and over TSID 11983
                      </a>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      Routed as an HST
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      <p>
                        Decision makers have concluded that this technology will not progress as a potential technology appraisal or a highly specialised technology. Traditional approaches to cost-effectiveness analysis, as used in TA, are not appropriate for antimicrobials. New antimicrobials will now be considered for NICE evaluation as part of NHS England’s Antimicrobial Products Subscription Model, which is expected in Summer 2024. Therefore, an evaluation of this product would not be appropriate.
                      </p>
